# Slot-value exclusion for the {pokemon} slot (OVOS-INTENT-2 §4.3).
#
# Every pronoun phrasing this skill ships has a slotted sibling that can
# swallow it: "what does it evolve into" matches
# "what does {pokemon} evolve into" with pokemon="it". The slot is then
# non-empty, the prev_pokemon fallback is never consulted, and the API is
# asked for a Pokemon called "it".
#
# Excluding the pronouns leaves the slot unfilled for that turn, so the
# follow-up resolves to the Pokemon of the previous turn, which is what the
# pronoun means.
it
its
that
this
that one
this one
them
those
these
they
